        "n": "SHUKAI - Estonian film music 1967–1986 (R)",
        "s": "2026-11-04T04:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-04T05:00:00Z",
        "d": "A unique dip into the musical history of Ukraine with archival label Shukai, journeying back to the ‘90s, playing music from documentaries, sci-fi films, obscure cartoons and late-night music programming, curated by Dmytro Nikolaienko, Dmytro Prutkin and Alec Tsapenko.\nFrom the host: \"A journey through Estonian film music (1967–1986) — from orchestral scores and jazz-infused soundtracks to early electronic experiments. Featuring works by Sven Grünberg, Raimo Kangro, Rein Rannap, and others, written for Estonian, Ukrainian, and Polish films, animation, and television.\"",
        "j": "Estonian film music 1967–1986",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/shukai/episodes/shukai-11th-march-2026",
        "t": "restream"
